BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Start & Grow Your Business with Enterprise Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T183000
UID:6a087391278f7c2f008d8a96@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Information session on how to start\, plan\, finance and grow 
 your very own small business.\nOwning a business is a dream for many peopl
 e. Every new business starts with an idea. This interactive presentation w
 ill give an overview of how to make it happen and the opportunity to ask q
 uestions related to your business. An advisor from Enterprise Toronto will
  present an overview of information related to the business planning proce
 ss\, evaluating a business idea\, financing\, marketing planning\, busines
 s structures\, regulatory requirements\, and more.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room1
