DESCRIPTION:Feeling crafty?\nDo you like to crochet\, embroider\, knit\, j
 ournal\, or something else entirely? If you are looking to chat with some 
 fellow crafters while enjoying your favourite hobby\, come join our Craft 
 and Chat.\nCraft and socialize in a friendly and welcoming environment. Un
 leash your talent\, express your creativity\, and make new friends.\nJoin 
 us twice a month for a fun hour of creativity. All skill levels welcome.\n
